# Kamehameha Tap blast (tier 0, released before "ka"). Generated by tools/gen_kame.py (numbers: KAMEHAMEHA.md). Destination design, no source script.
# Beam = four spheres along the hands, built out over 3 clip frames, re-hitting every 5 frames; the beam effect is fx P_TrailGokuKameTap.
PUT ANIM_RATE 1.0
clear_hitboxes
wait_until 5
sfx behavior=1 sfx_id=540001 volume=0 panning=64
sfx behavior=1 sfx_id=200118 volume=127 panning=64
